OL,3,CStar Wars dubbed into Welsh for the
OL,4,Cfirst time to mark 50th anniversary
OL,6,FThe first film of the classic Star
OL,7,FWars franchise is to be dubbed in
OL,8,FWelsh for the first time to mark its
OL,9,F50th anniversary next year.
OL,11,FStar Wars: A New Hope, originally
OL,12,Freleased in 1977, has been produced by
OL,13,FLucasfilm and Disney in collaboration
OL,14,Fwith S4C and the Welsh Government to
OL,15,Fbe entirely in the Welsh language.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/5
