PN,43902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F439A1786182471
OL,3,CStar Wars dubbed into Welsh for the
OL,4,Cfirst time to mark 50th anniversary
OL,6,FIts new title, Star Wars: Gobaith
OL,7,FNewydd, will be voiced by iconic Welsh
OL,8,Factors including Matthew Rhys as Han
OL,9,FSolo, Rhys Ifans as Obi-Wan Kenobi,
OL,10,Fand Aimee-Ffion Edwards as Princess
OL,11,FLeia.
OL,13,FMark Lewis Jones, who appeared in Star
OL,14,FWars: The Last Jedi in 2017, will play
OL,15,FDarth Vader, and Osian Morgan takes on
OL,16,Fthe role of Luke Skywalker.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/5
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
