PN,43903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F439A1786182471
OL,3,CStar Wars dubbed into Welsh for the
OL,4,Cfirst time to mark 50th anniversary
OL,6,FCo-president of Lucasfilm, Lynwen
OL,7,FBrennan, who is from Wales, said:
OL,8,F"Wales has such a rich history of
OL,9,Fstorytelling and a beautiful lyrical
OL,10,Flanguage.
OL,12,F"We have never before had a
OL,13,Ftranslation of Star Wars into Welsh
OL,14,Fand I am so thankful that in
OL,15,Fcelebration of our 50th anniversary we
OL,16,Fhave been able to work with some
OL,17,Fincredible Welsh talent to make that a
OL,18,Freality.
OL,26,@pD@AOUtD@AOU
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/5
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
