OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,451,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F439A1786182471
OL,3,CStar Wars dubbed into Welsh for the
OL,4,Cfirst time to mark 50th anniversary
OL,6,F"Welsh speakers will finally be able
OL,7,Fto enjoy the film in our native
OL,8,Flanguage and my hope is that it will
OL,9,Fhave the same emotional impact as if
OL,10,Fyou were watching the film again for
OL,11,Fthe first time."
OL,13,FFirst Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth
OL,14,Fdescribed the Welsh-dubbed film as
OL,15,F"fantastic".
OL,17,FHe said: "Star Wars was one of the
OL,18,Fmost influential films of my childhood
OL,19,Fand its appeal shows no sign of
OL,20,Fwaning, captivating audiences to this
OL,21,Fday.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@PO]yD@JOU
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/5
