FL,451,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F439A1786182471
OL,3,CStar Wars dubbed into Welsh for the
OL,4,Cfirst time to mark 50th anniversary
OL,6,F"To see a Welsh language version of
OL,7,Fthis iconic film, using the talents of
OL,8,Fsome of our best actors, is fantastic.
OL,9,FWe already produce world-class TV and
OL,10,Ffilm here in Wales and I'm really
OL,11,Flooking forward to seeing Star Wars in
OL,12,FWelsh later this year."
OL,14,FStar Wars: Gobaith Newydd will be
OL,15,Fshown on S4C and across its platforms
OL,16,Ffrom Christmas Day.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@WO]
